FeatureExtraction SQL rendered for the RWD Cohort Discovery solution

The SQL files in this folder are generated by tools/render_feature_extraction.py from the SQL
templates of FeatureExtraction 3.14.0 (https://github.com/OHDSI/FeatureExtraction) and translated with
SqlRender 1.19.7 (https://github.com/OHDSI/SqlRender). Both are Copyright Observational Health Data
Sciences and Informatics and licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:
https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

Changes: the templates are rendered for the presets listed in MANIFEST.json, with the placeholders
described there left for the solution to fill, and translated to each folder's dialect.
